g src="$cover3d" alt="Interactive-edit-3D 项目封面"><div class="project-info"><small class="role">腾讯犀牛鸟 · AI × 3D</small><h3>Interactive-edit-3D</h3><p>把一张普通图片变成可交互的 3D 模型，完成从交互式抠像、图像补全到 3D 生成的一体化流程。</p><div class="tags"><span class="tag">SAM 分割</span><span class="tag">Qwen 补全</span><span class="tag">Hunyuan3D</span><span class="tag">模型评测</span></div><div class="metrics"><span><b>60s</b><br>单个 3D 生成</span><span><b>TOP 4.3%</b><br>优秀学生</span></div><p class="project-link"><a href="https://github.com/Wenrui0319/middletask-1-1-hunyuan" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">查看 GitHub 项目 ↗</a></p></div></article><article class="project"><img src="$coverZhijing" alt="智聘助手项目封面"><div class="project-info"><small class="role">AI Agent · 从场景定义到数据验证</small><h3>智聘助手项目</h3><p>将企业任务拆解为 4 类 Skill，通过 8 套 Prompt 与 16 轮 Badcase 迭代，构建任务解析—资源检索—商机匹配 Agent。</p><div class="tags"><span class="tag">场景定义</span><span class="tag">工具调用</span><span class="tag">数据验证</span><span class="tag">A/B 测试</span></div><div class="metrics"><span><b>3×</b><br>商机匹配</span><span><b>60→95%</b><br>提取准确率</span></div></div></article></div></div></section>
